+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="ISO-8859-1"?>
+<!-- edited with XMLSPY v2004 rel. 2 U (http://www.xmlspy.com) by Alex Mantzaris (Firaxis Games) -->
+<!-- Sid Meier's Civilization 4 -->
+<!-- Copyright Firaxis Games 2005 -->
+<!-- -->
+<!-- Game Text Diplomacy -->
+<!-- *ActualQuotes* by Willowmound, ver. 4.20 (Beyond the Sword) -->
+<!-- Leader-specific diplomacy text based on actual quotes, complete or paraphrased. Some other minor changes. -->
+<Civ4GameText xmlns="http://www.firaxis.com">
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_1</Tag>
+		<English>This world isn't big enough for the two of us! ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Ce monde n'est pas assez grand pour nous deux ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Diese Welt ist nicht gro&#223; genug f&#252;r uns beide! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>Questo mondo non &#232; grande abbastanza per tutti e due! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Este mundo no es lo bastante grande para nuestras dos naciones! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_2</Tag>
+		<English>We have suffered your insolence for long enough! ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Nous n'avons support&#233; que trop longtemps votre insolence ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Wir haben Eure Anma&#223;ungen lange genug ertragen! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>Abbiamo subito le tue insolenze troppo a lungo! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Ya hemos aguantado bastante vuestras insolencias! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_3</Tag>
+		<English>Prepare to meet your doom! ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Votre fin est proche ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Bereitet Euch auf Euren Untergang vor! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>Preparati ad affrontare il tuo destino! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Preparaos para afrontar vuestra perdici&#243;n! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_4</Tag>
+		<English>Now you shall pay for your many insults to the [OUR_EMPIRE]! ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Vous allez payer vos innombrables insultes envers l'[OUR_EMPIRE] ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Jetzt werdet Ihr f&#252;r Eure Respektlosigkeit gegen&#252;ber dem [OUR_EMPIRE:3] b&#252;&#223;en! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>Ora pagherai per aver insultato l'[OUR_EMPIRE]! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Ahora pagar&#233;is vuestros incontables insultos al [OUR_EMPIRE]! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_5</Tag>
+		<English>The time for talking is over, [CT_NAME]! We shall shall settle this on the field of battle! ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>L'heure n'est plus aux pourparlers, [CT_NAME] ! Nous r&#233;glerons ceci sur le champ de bataille ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Die Zeit der Verhandlungen ist vorbei, [CT_NAME]! Regeln wir die Sache auf dem Schlachtfeld! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>&#200; finito il tempo delle chiacchiere, [CT_NAME]! Risolveremo la questione sul campo di battaglia! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Se acab&#243; la charla, [CT_NAME]! &#161;Zanjaremos nuestras diferencias en el campo de batalla! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_6</Tag>
+		<English>My [OUR_BEST_UNIT]s are marching, [CT_NAME]. It's war. ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Bient&#244;t, mes innombrables guerriers vous extermineront jusqu'au dernier ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Meine zahllosen Untertanen werden Euch vernichten! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>I miei innumerevoli seguaci vi stermineranno rapidamente! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Pronto mis incontables seguidores os destruir&#225;n a todos! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_7</Tag>
+		<English>Time to die, [CT_NAME]. ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>L'heure de votre mort a sonn&#233;, [CT_NAME]. ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Zeit zu sterben, [CT_NAME]! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>&#200; tempo di morire, [CT_NAME]. ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Es hora de morir, [CT_NAME]. (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_8</Tag>
+		<English>Fool! Now we shall destroy you! ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Imb&#233;cile ! Maintenant, nous allons vous d&#233;truire ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Dummkopf! Wir werden Euch vernichten! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>Folle! Ti distruggeremo! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Idiota! &#161;Ahora os destruiremos! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_9</Tag>
+		<English>I suppose you realise this means war. ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Je suppose que vous r&#233;alisez que cela signifie la guerre ? ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Ich denke Ihr wisst, dass das Krieg bedeutet! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>Credo tu sappia che questo significa guerra. ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Supongo que os dais cuenta de que esto significa la guerra. (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_10</Tag>
+		<English>The mighty [OUR_EMPIRE] has had enough of your deceit. Now you pay! ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Le puissant [OUR_EMPIRE] ne peut plus supporter vos trahisons et vos tromperies ! Maintenant, il faut payer ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Das m&#228;chtige [OUR_EMPIRE:2] hat genug von Euren betr&#252;gerischen Machenschaften! Jetzt werdet Ihr daf&#252;r bezahlen! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>L'[OUR_EMPIRE] ne ha abbastanza della tua perfidia e dei tuoi tradimenti! Ora pagherai! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;El poderoso [OUR_EMPIRE] ya ha soportado bastante vuestras traiciones y enga&#241;os! &#161;Lo vais a pagar! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings! I am [OUR_NAME] of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. Be sincere; be brief; be seated. I hope our peoples can live together in peace.</English>
+		<French>Salutations ! Je suis [OUR_NAME], je r&#232;gne sur l'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Je souhaite que nos deux grands peuples puissent vivre en paix.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t! Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt des [OUR_EMPIRE:3]es. Ich hoffe, unsere gro&#223;artigen V&#246;lker werden in Frieden zusammenleben.</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti! Io sono [OUR_NAME] dell'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Spero che i nostri due grandi popoli possano vivere in pace.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos. &#161;Soy [OUR_NAME], del [OUR_EMPIRE]! Espero que nuestros dos grandes pueblos puedan vivir en paz.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_2</Tag>
+		<English>I am [OUR_NAME] of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. I hope this will be the first meeting of many, [CT_NAME]. If civilisation is to survive, we must cultivate the science of human relationships -- the ability of all peoples, of all kinds, to live together in the same world at peace.</English>
+		<French>Salutations ! Je suis [OUR_NAME], je r&#232;gne sur l'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Je souhaite que nos deux grands peuples puissent vivre en paix.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t! Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt des [OUR_EMPIRE:3]es. Ich hoffe, unsere gro&#223;artigen V&#246;lker werden in Frieden zusammenleben.</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti! Io sono [OUR_NAME] dell'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Spero che i nostri due grandi popoli possano vivere in pace.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos. &#161;Soy [OUR_NAME], del [OUR_EMPIRE]! Espero que nuestros dos grandes pueblos puedan vivir en paz.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_3</Tag>
+		<English>Well met! I am [OUR_NAME]. The point in history at which we stand is full of promise and danger. The world will either move forward toward unity and widely shared prosperity -- or it will move apart. Which shall it be, [CT_NAME]?</English>
+		<French>Salutations ! Je suis [OUR_NAME], je r&#232;gne sur l'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Je souhaite que nos deux grands peuples puissent vivre en paix.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t! Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt des [OUR_EMPIRE:3]es. Ich hoffe, unsere gro&#223;artigen V&#246;lker werden in Frieden zusammenleben.</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti! Io sono [OUR_NAME] dell'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Spero che i nostri due grandi popoli possano vivere in pace.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos. &#161;Soy [OUR_NAME], del [OUR_EMPIRE]! Espero que nuestros dos grandes pueblos puedan vivir en paz.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_WASHINGTON_1</Tag>
+		<English>Hello there! I am [OUR_NAME] of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. Associate yourself with men of good quality, [CT_NAME], if you esteem your own reputation. It is better be alone than in bad company.</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue, [CT_NAME] ! Je ne peux pas mentir : &#231;a me fait plaisir de vous rencontrer !</French>
+		<German>Willkommen, [CT_NAME]! Ich kann es nicht leugnen: Ich bin mehr als erfreut, Euch kennen zu lernen!</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto, [CT_NAME]! Non mentir&#242;, sono incredibilmente contento di vederti!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Os doy la bienvenida, [CT_NAME]! No puedo mentiros, estoy encantad&#237;simo de conoceros.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_WASHINGTON_2</Tag>
+		<English>Welcome, [CT_NAME]. I am [OUR_NAME], the leader of [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. I have no other view than to promote the public good, and am unambitious of honours not founded in the approbation of my country.</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue, [CT_NAME] ! Je ne peux pas mentir : &#231;a me fait plaisir de vous rencontrer !</French>
+		<German>Willkommen, [CT_NAME]! Ich kann es nicht leugnen: Ich bin mehr als erfreut, Euch kennen zu lernen!</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto, [CT_NAME]! Non mentir&#242;, sono incredibilmente contento di vederti!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Os doy la bienvenida, [CT_NAME]! No puedo mentiros, estoy encantad&#237;simo de conoceros.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_WASHINGTON_3</Tag>
+		<English>Good to meet you, [CT_NAME]. I'm [OUR_NAME]. Observe good faith and justice toward all nations. Cultivate peace and harmony with all. That's my advice. What do you say?</English>
