+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_ALEXANDER_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings, [CT_NAME]! I am [OUR_NAME], ruler of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. You should know the world will be mine -- there is nothing impossible to him who will try.</English>
