+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_GANDHI_1</Tag>
+		<English>Welcome to my humble home, [CT_NAME]. [OUR_CIV_SHORT] desires peace with all of her neighbours. Remember: A coward is incapable of exhibiting love; it is the prerogative of the brave.</English>
