+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_TOKUGAWA_1</Tag>
+		<English>Konnichiwa, [CT_NAME]-san. I am [OUR_NAME]. If you know only what it is to conquer, and not what it is to be defeated, woe unto you; it will fare ill with you.</English>
