+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_MANSA_MUSA_1</Tag>
+		<English>Ah, hello to you. I am [OUR_NAME], the Lion of [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. I am sorry, but I came for the Pilgrimage and nothing else.  I do not wish to mix anything else with my Pilgrimage.</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue, [CT_NAME]. Moi, [OUR_NAME], humble chef des [OUR_CIV_SHORT], je vous tends la main en signe d'amiti&#233;.</French>
