+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto, [CT_NAME]. Io, [OUR_NAME], umile sovrano [OUR_CIV_SHORT:3], ti offro la mia amicizia.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos, [CT_NAME]. Nos, [OUR_NAME], humilde mandatario de la tierra de [OUR_CIV_SHORT], os tendemos la mano en prueba de amistad. </Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_GENGHIS_KHAN_1</Tag>
+		<English>Welcome, oh leader of the [CT_EMPIRE]. I am [OUR_NAME]. It is not sufficient that I succeed -- all others must fail.</English>
