+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_JULIUS_CAESAR_3</Tag>
+		<English>I greet you, [CT_NAME]! I am [OUR_NAME] of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. As a rule, men worry more about what they can't see than about what they can. I offer to you friendship and openness. For now.</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue chez les [OUR_CIV_SHORT], [CT_NAME]. Voulez-vous un peu de salade ? Je l'ai pr&#233;par&#233;e moi-m&#234;me.</French>
