+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_BISMARCK_1</Tag>
+		<English>A government must not waiver once it has chosen its course, [CT_NAME]. It must not look to the left or right, but go forward. This war is not yet over.</English>
+		<French>Votre requ&#234;te est rejet&#233;e. Bienvenue dans la guerre ouverte, [CT_NAME].</French>
+		<German>Eure Bitte wird abgewiesen! Willkommen im Krieg, [CT_NAME]!</German>
+		<Italian>Richiesta negata. Benvenuto nella guerra totale, [CT_NAME].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Petici&#243;n denegada. Os damos la bienvenida a la guerra total, [CT_NAME].</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_FREDERICK_1</Tag>
+		<English>What is the good of experience if you do not reflect? Clearly, your lesson in humility is far from over!</English>
+		<French>Votre requ&#234;te est rejet&#233;e. Bienvenue dans la guerre ouverte, [CT_NAME].</French>
