+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_CATHERINE_1</Tag>
+		<English>I may be kindly, I am ordinarily gentle, but in my line of business I am obliged to will terribly what I will, and I will not let you dictate peace!</English>
