+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_VICTORIA_1</Tag>
+		<English>I hate politics and turmoil, [CT_NAME]. We women are not made for governing, and if we are good women, we must dislike these masculine occupations. There are times which force one to take interest in them, however, and I do of course intensely. Was there anything in particular you wished to discuss?</English>
