+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ASOKA_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings, fair [CT_NAME]! Respect for your mother and father is good, generosity to friends and acquaintances is good. Let us do good today!</English>
