+		<Italian>Saluti, ragionevole [CT_NAME]! Che le nostre nazioni possano vivere in pace e armonia!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Saludos, [CT_NAME]! &#161;Que nuestros dos pa&#237;ses vivan siempre en paz y armon&#237;a!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_GANDHI_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings, [CT_NAME]. Always aim at complete harmony of thought and word and deed. Always aim at purifying your thoughts, and everything will be well.</English>
