+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_GANDHI_2</Tag>
+		<English>Love never claims, it ever gives. Love ever suffers, never resents, never revenges itself. I love you, [CT_NAME]. I love you sooo much!</English>
