+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_4</Tag>
+		<English>Know that [OUR_CIV_SHORT] stands by [CT_CIV_SHORT]'s side as friend and equal Now -- about our fee...</English>
