+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_5</Tag>
+		<English>Peace with the [OUR_EMPIRE] comes with a price, [CT_NAME]. Will you pay?</English>
