+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1</Tag>
+		<English>It isn't sufficient just to want -- you've got to ask yourself what you are going to do to get the things you want. Well, I have done just that, and you know, there is nothing I love as much as a good fight.</English>
