+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_QIN_SHI_HUANG_1</Tag>
+		<English>High and low, noble and humble; none dare overshoot the mark. Provide us with this so that balance may be preserved.</English>
