+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_GILGAMESH_1</Tag>
+		<English>I had a dream just now. I lay helpless on the ground. Above a great bull bellowed in delight. Each breath on me did I feel, each stamp of hooves as the ground shook. ...And yet I was brought water to slake my thirst.</English>
