+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_GILGAMESH_1</Tag>
+		<English>I had a dream just now. Dark lightening did make bright all about. A thunder shook me from head to feet. And fire rained, and ash came after fire and covered all things. You must answer this omen with sacrifice, [CT_NAME].</English>
+		<French>Si vous souhaitez que votre pitoyable civilisation survive, je vous conseille de nous faire une modeste donation. Imm�diatement.</French>
+		<German>Wenn Euch am �berleben Eurer armseligen Zivilisation gelegen ist, solltet Ihr uns schleunigst Tribut zollen. Sofort!</German>
+		<Italian>Se vuoi che la tua debole civilt� sopravviva, ti consiglio di farci una piccola donazione. Immediatamente.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Si quer�is que vuestra insignificante civilizaci�n sobreviva, os insto a que nos hag�is un peque�o donativo. De inmediato.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_BOUDICA_1</Tag>
+		<English>I am [OUR_NAME], Queen of the [OUR_CIV_ADJ]. The Gods are on our side in our quest for vengeance. Are you?</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue, [CT_NAME] ! Les puissants [OUR_CIV_SHORT:3] veulent la paix avec votre mis�rable civilisation. Enfin, pour l'instant.</French>
+		<German>Willkommen, [CT_NAME]! Das m�chtige Volk von [OUR_CIV_SHORT] w�nscht friedvolle Beziehungen zu Eurer bedauernswerten Nation. Zumindest f�r den Augenblick ...</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto, [CT_NAME]! [OUR_CIV_SHORT] vuole la pace con la tua piccola e debole civilt�. Per il momento, almeno.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>�Os doy la bienvenida, [CT_NAME]! La poderosa tierra de [OUR_CIV_SHORT] busca la paz con vuestra d�bil civilizaci�n de pacotilla. De momento, claro est�.</Spanish>
