+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_BOUDICA_1</Tag>
+		<English>[CT_CIV_ADJ] greed spares neither the old or the virgins. We will fight you.</English>
+		<French>Ne me faites pas rire !</French>
+		<German>Macht Euch nicht l�cherlich!</German>
