+		<Spanish>�No me hag�is re�r!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_BOUDICA_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings, [CT_NAME]! I smell victory this day.</English>
+		<French>Mes respects, [CT_NAME] ! Montons sur mon puissant char et sus aux barbares ! Mais c'est moi qui conduis !</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr��t, [CT_NAME]! Lasst uns meinen prachtvollen Streitwagen besteigen und ein paar Barbaren jagen! Ihr d�rft mein "Beifahrer" sein!</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti, [CT_NAME]! Monta sul mio potente cocchio e diamo insieme la caccia a qualche barbaro! Puoi stare davanti, se vuoi!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>�Saludos, [CT_NAME]! �Montemos en mi imponente carro y vayamos a cazar unos b�rbaros! �Podr�is sentaros a mi lado!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_BOUDICA_1</Tag>
+		<English>When the [CT_CIV_ADJ] people realise their small force and the justice of our cause, they will know it is victory or death.</English>
