+		<Spanish>Adelante, alegradme el d�a. </Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_BOUDICA_1</Tag>
