+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_TRIGGER_BLIZZARD_2</Tag>
+		<English>Massive snowfall has buried a region of our territory near %s2_city.</English>
+		<French>Des chutes de neige colossales ont enseveli une de nos r&#233;gions pr&#232;s de %s2_city.</French>
