+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_TRIGGER_SOUR_CRUDE_1</Tag>
+		<English>Most of the crude oil being pumped from one of our sites is thick with sulfur and other impurities. We are stuck with a source of sour crude!</English>
