+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_TRIGGER_BEST_DEFENSE</Tag>
+		<English>Our generals request government aid in expanding our fortifications.[PARAGRAPH:1]We will need to build enough [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Castles[COLOR_REVERT] to satisfy their views on mounting a proper defense for our nation.</English>
