+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_BEST_DEFENSE_1</Tag>
+		<English>The Best Defense[PARAGRAPH:1]You are tasked by your armed forces to build enough [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Castles[COLOR_REVERT] for them to ward off invasion effectively.</English>
