+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_IMMIGRANTS_1</Tag>
+		<English>We are pleased at their new choice of residence.</English>
+		<French>Nous sommes ravis de leur decision de s'installer ici.</French>
