@@ -0,0 +1,706 @@
+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="ISO-8859-1"?>
+<!-- edited with XMLSPY v2004 rel. 2 U (http://www.xmlspy.com) by XMLSPY 2004 Professional Ed. Release 2, Installed Multi + SMP for 3 users (Firaxis Games) -->
+<!-- Sid Meier's Civilization 4 -->
+<!-- Copyright Firaxis Games 2005 -->
+<!-- -->
+<!-- Game Text Diplomacy -->
+<!-- *ActualQuotes* by Willowmound, ver. 4.20 (Beyond the Sword) -->
+<!-- Leader-specific diplomacy text based on actual quotes, complete or paraphrased. Some other minor changes. -->
+<Civ4GameText xmlns="http://www.firaxis.com">
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_AUGUSTUS_CAESAR_1</Tag>
+		<English>Well met, [CT_NAME]! I like treachery, but I cannot say anything good of traitors. Yes. Well, at least I'm honest.</English>
+		<French>Quelle joie de vous rencontrer, [CT_NAME] ! Auriez-vous l'obligeance de vous capituler imm&#233;diatement face &#224; la puissance des [OUR_CIV_SHORT] ou souhaitez-vous repousser l'in&#233;vitable encore quelques temps ?</French>
+		<German>Es freut mich, Eure Bekanntschaft zu machen, [CT_NAME]! Seid Ihr bereit, vor dem Volk von [OUR_CIV_SHORT] zu kapitulieren oder zieht Ihr es vor, das Unvermeidliche noch etwas hinauszuz�gern?</German>
+		<Italian>Sono felice di incontrarti, [CT_NAME]! Desideri arrenderti alla nostra potente civilt� ora o preferisci rimandare l'inevitabile per qualche tempo?</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Es un honor conoceros, [CT_NAME]. �Os importar�a rendiros a la poderosa tierra de [OUR_CIV_SHORT] ahora mismo o prefer�s aplazar lo inevitable por un tiempo?</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_BRENNUS_1</Tag>
+		<English>Chroesawa ddieithr! We are the [OUR_CIV_ADJ], and I am their leader, [OUR_NAME]. Woe to the vanquished -- will you share peace, or die?</English>
+		<French>Salutations, [CT_NAME] ! Je suis [OUR_NAME] du belliqueux peuple des [OUR_CIV_ADJ] ! Mes druides vont faire &#233;riger un large cercle de pierres pour c&#233;l&#233;brer cette formidable rencontre !</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr��t, [CT_NAME]! Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt des kriegerischen [CT_CIV_ADJ:2] Volkes! Meine Druiden werden zur Feier dieses denkw�rdigen Augenblicks einen riesigen Steinkreis errichten!</German>
+		<Italian>Salve, [CT_NAME]! Io sono [OUR_NAME] [OUR_CIV_ADJ]! I miei druidi erigeranno un enorme cerchio di pietre per commemorare questo incontro propizio!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>�Saludos, [CT_NAME]! Soy [OUR_NAME], del belicoso pueblo [OUR_CIV_ADJ:1].  Mis druidas construir�n un gran c�rculo de piedra para conmemorar esta propicia ocasi�n.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_HANNIBAL_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings. I am [OUR_NAME], leader of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. We will either find a way, or make one. That is the [OUR_CIV_ADJ] way.</English>
+		<French>Le fier peuple des [OUR_CIV_ADJ] souhaite la bienvenue &#224; la petite civilisation des [CT_CIV_SHORT] !</French>
+		<German>Die ruhmreichen B�rger von [OUR_CIV_SHORT] hei�en das niedliche kleine V�lkchen von [CT_CIV_SHORT] willkommen!</German>
+		<Italian>Il glorioso leader [OUR_CIV_ADJ] d� il benvenuto alla tua insignificante civilt�!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>El glorioso pueblo [OUR_CIV_ADJ:1] le da la bienvenida a la encantadora y diminuta tierra de [CT_CIV_SHORT].</Spanish>
